I started a game as a Valkyrie the other day (NH3.7), and on the first 
level I found a chaotic altar.  There were some goblins wandering the
room which my pet slayed.  I sacrificed the bodies and was presented
with Stormbringer as a reward.  This is all very nice, but shouldn't
the more powerful weapons be restricted to lower levels - I don't
reckon a god should give such a weapon to a 1st level character!?

I was then lucky enough to find a food shop on level 2, and a good
game developed ...

Not that I'm saying the game is too easy, far from it :-)

Has anyone else got any tales of remarkable good fortune from
nethack games?  Talk on this group tends to be about game
improvements, rather than about games played.  The latter is
a more common talking point amongst "hackers" here!

Looking forward to PL8 ...

